# Project context

Before suggesting architecture, stack, or scope changes, read `CONTEXT.md` and `REJECTED.md` at the repo root. Treat them as current truth. Never re-propose items listed in `REJECTED.md`.

Outside an explicit `/grill-with-docs` session, if a real decision should be recorded: propose the exact edit to `CONTEXT.md` and/or `REJECTED.md`, and ask the user before writing.
